aby&#39;s care. Study your daily routine. A complete history of events, the ability to filter them by type (for example, only walks or pump log) is always at your fingertips.<br><br>REMINDERS<br>Set reminders for the events you need. You will not miss your medication and will not forget to feed or put your child to bed at the right time.<br><br>PREMIUM VERSION<br><br>The Premium version has the full functionality of the application:<br><br>Restore and sync recordings across multiple devices;<br>Reminders for the exact date and time, the ability to turn off recurring reminders at night;<br>Full access to statistics;<br>Daily routine for all time;<br>Customizable widgets on the main page of the application;<br>Export data to Excel for analysis and printing;<br>Teeth records;<br>No ads.<br><br>Erby is not just a baby development and feeding log, it is a memory of your precious first months with him.<br><br>You can keep a diary for multiple children. Suitable for twins!<br><br>Our breast feeding app was created to help even the most sleep-deprived parents keep track of their baby&#39;s progress up to one-year-old by recording daily activities and feeding statistics in this easy-to-use diary.<br><br>We are always glad to receive your questions, suggestions, comments. Email us at support@whisperarts.com",
